(CHAPTER 1: THE SYNOPTIC GOSPELS) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
0 -35 Td
(Section 1.1 - The Gospel According to Matthew) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -40 Td
(Matthew was written primarily to Jewish believers, presenting Jesus) '
(as the Promised Messiah, the Son of David, and the King of the Jews.) '
(Key Theological Themes:) '
(1. The Fulfillment of Old Testament Messianic Prophecies) '
(2. The Kingdom of Heaven (Basileia ton Ouranon)) '
(3. The Great Commission (Matthew 28:18-20)) '
() '
(The structure features five major discourses corresponding to the Pentateuch.) '
ET
endstream
