/F1 12 Tf
0 -35 Td
(Section 1.2 - The Servant Messiah and the Son of Man) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -40 Td
(Mark presents the fast-paced, action-oriented ministry of Jesus as) '
(the Suffering Servant who came to give His life as a ransom for many.) '
() '
(Luke provides the orderly historical account addressed to Theophilus,) '
(emphasizing the compassionate Savior who seeks and saves the lost,) '
(with prominent attention to prayer, the Holy Spirit, and outcasts.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
