(Section 1.3 - The Word Made Flesh (The Logos)) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -40 Td
(John presents the profound theological reality of Christ's deity:) '
("In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God,) '
(and the Word was God" (John 1:1).) '
() '
(The Seven Sign Miracles demonstrate Jesus as the Son of God,) '
(leading readers to believe and receive eternal life (John 20:30-31).) '
ET
endstream
endobj
