(Section 2.1 - The Holy Spirit and Global Witness) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -40 Td
(Acts documents the explosive birth and geographical expansion of the church,) '
(fulfilling the mandate of Acts 1:8:) '
(From Jerusalem (Ch 1-7) to Judea & Samaria (Ch 8-12) to the Ends of the Earth (Ch 13-28).) '
() '
(The missionary journeys of the Apostle Paul illustrate contextualized) '
(evangelism across Antioch, Galatia, Greece, and Rome.) '
ET
endstream
