(APPENDIX A: THEOLOGICAL GLOSSARY) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
0 -35 Td
(Key Terms for Exegetical Study) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -40 Td
(1. Atonement (Hilasterion) - Propitiation and reconciliation through Christ.) '
(2. Regeneration (Palingenesia) - Spiritual rebirth effected by the Holy Spirit.) '
(3. Sanctification (Hagiasmos) - Consecration and ongoing growth in holiness.) '
(4. Eschatology - The biblical doctrine of the last things and final redemption.) '
ET
endstream
